1.  LogFest is not, and has never been, an official LLG activity.

2.  Anyone is welcome to run one.

3.  I'd love to go to one this year.

4.  I'm too busy and tired to put much effort into running one.  I'm
thinking of doing a small one, but there won't be much to it and
shouldn't stop people from running their own.

5.  Same with Bob.

So, if you want LogFest, please, go for it!

